            <div xml:id="d648">

                <pb facs="0557" n="441" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg441"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 882.51/633.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Monrovia</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-11-28">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 28, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Clark says revenues November insufficient for payment cost of collection and
                    interest due November 30. New York bankers refuse loan. Can anything be done to
                    prevent default?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Buckner</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
